    "detailed_description": "You cannot survive the relentless forces of good alone. Better call allies from the Abyss! <br>Gather the necessary ingredients and summon them from your cauldron.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><strong>Call the Abyss</strong> is a thrilling <strong>2D survival arcade game</strong> packed with action and magic. This unique experience challenges you to push your limits while defending a dark and mysterious world. And the best part? It's completely <strong>FREE</strong>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\t<strong>Survival Mode:</strong> Face endless waves of enemies in frantic and strategic combat.<br></li><li>\t<strong>Summoning Theme:</strong> Developed in three days for Ludum Dare Jam. The theme was <i>Summoning</i>, so the player starts off weak, but don't worry, your summoned allies are the key to victory!<br></li><li>\t<strong>Allies:</strong> Gather resources and use your magical cauldron to summon powerful allies.<br></li><li>\t<strong>Totems:</strong> Use totems to boost your team stats while they remain alive.<br></li><li>\t<strong>Aim with Your Mouse:</strong> Direct all your allies' attacks by aiming with your mouse.<br></li><li>\t<strong>Global Leaderboards:</strong> Climb to the top of the leaderboard and leave your mark on history.<br></li><li>\t<strong>Hand Drawn Style:</strong> Enjoy the dark fantasy style with meticulously crafted graphics.<br></li><li>\t<strong>100% Free:</strong> Yes, we know, some just do it for the fun.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat Styles</h2>Choose your preferred survival style and adjust your strategy to dominate the battlefield.<br><br>-------------------------------------------- <strong>Melee</strong> --------------------------------------------<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/658eb6bcb7e006a1ca59da26bd79a74c.poster.avif?t=1745538105\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/658eb6bcb7e006a1ca59da26bd79a74c.webm?t=1745538105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/658eb6bcb7e006a1ca59da26bd79a74c.mp4?t=1745538105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>------------------------------------------- <strong>Ranged</strong> -------------------------------------------<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/a56034502a40994b919cd61d72d80732.poster.avif?t=1745538105\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/a56034502a40994b919cd61d72d80732.webm?t=1745538105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/a56034502a40994b919cd61d72d80732.mp4?t=1745538105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>--------------------------------------------- <strong>Elite</strong> ---------------------------------------------<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/8e9722172ed53108557654346fe59d21.poster.avif?t=1745538105\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/8e9722172ed53108557654346fe59d21.webm?t=1745538105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/8e9722172ed53108557654346fe59d21.mp4?t=1745538105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>-------------------------------------------- <strong>Totem</strong> --------------------------------------------<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/33d0c77ad33c360b9dc9ae4f708c22a9.poster.avif?t=1745538105\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/33d0c77ad33c360b9dc9ae4f708c22a9.webm?t=1745538105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149360/extras/33d0c77ad33c360b9dc9ae4f708c22a9.mp4?t=1745538105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Download now and dive into the abyss... if you dare!",
